@startuml get-info
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/v1/user/info
caption CRB-10 · 내 정보, 가입 다음 단계(next_step), 재동의 필요 여부, 유형별 정보

actor Client
participant "AnyStatusGuard" as Guard
participant "UserController" as Controller
participant "UserService" as Service
participant "AuthService" as AuthService
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepository
participant "CoffeeChatContactRepository" as CoffeeChatContactRepository
participant "StudentRepository" as StudentRepository
participant "StudentProfileRepository" as StudentProfileRepository
participant "StudentProfileAttachmentRepository" as StudentProfileAttachmentRepository
participant "GraduatedRepository" as GraduatedRepository
participant "GraduatedProfileRepository" as GraduatedProfileRepository
database PostgreSQL
participant "S3"

Client -> Guard: GET /api/v1/user/info\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>
ref over Client, Guard: authenticate() — flow/auth-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token
note right of Guard: 가입 상태와 관계없이 통과 (pending · active)
Guard -> Controller: getInfo(user)
Controller -> Service: getInfo(userCtx)

Service -> UserRepository: findByPk(userPk)
UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT users (is_deleted = false)
PostgreSQL --> UserRepository: row
UserRepository --> Service: user | null
alt 유저 없음 (탈퇴)
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 401 User not found
end
note right of Service
  토큰 클레임은 유형 변경 · 가입 완료 전 값일 수 있어
  이후 응답은 모두 DB의 type · status 기준
end note

par 동시에 조회
  Service -> UserRepository: findSignupProgress(pk, type)
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: 필수 약관 미동의 여부,\n유형별 인증(verified_at) · 추가 정보 존재 여부
  PostgreSQL --> UserRepository: row
  UserRepository --> Service: { hasMissingRequiredConsent, verified, hasProfile }
else
  Service -> CoffeeChatContactRepository: findByUserPk(pk)
  CoffeeChatContactRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT coffee_chat_contact
  CoffeeChatContactRepository --> Service: contact | null
end

alt type = student
  Service -> StudentRepository: findByUserPk(pk)
  StudentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT student
  StudentRepository --> Service: student
  Service -> StudentProfileRepository: findLatestByStudentPk(studentPk)
  StudentProfileRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT student_profile JOIN department\nORDER BY version DESC LIMIT 1
  note right: 현재 정보 = 가장 큰 version
  StudentProfileRepository --> Service: { profile, department } | null
  opt 추가 정보가 있음
    Service -> StudentProfileAttachmentRepository: findByProfilePk(profilePk)
    StudentProfileAttachmentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT student_profile_attachment ORDER BY sort_order
    StudentProfileAttachmentRepository --> Service: attachments
    loop source = file인 첨부
      Service -> S3: getPresignedUrl(key)
      note right: 비공개 버킷이라 presigned URL로 내려줌.\n서명은 서버에서 계산 (S3 호출 없음)
      alt 서명 실패 (FileService가 InternalServerErrorException)
        Service -[#red]-> Client: 500 Internal Server Error
      end
    end
  end
else type = graduated
  Service -> GraduatedRepository: findByUserPk(pk)
  GraduatedRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT graduated
  GraduatedRepository --> Service: graduated
  Service -> GraduatedProfileRepository: findByGraduatedPk(graduatedPk)
  GraduatedProfileRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT graduated_profile
  GraduatedProfileRepository --> Service: profile | null
end

Service -> AuthService: touchLastActive(pk)
AuthService -> UserRepository: updateLastActiveAt(pk)
UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE users SET last_active_at = now()
note right of Service: 트랜잭션 없음 (조회 + 최근 접속 시각 갱신만)

Service -> Service: next_step = calculateNextStep(status, progress)\nconsent_required = active && hasMissingRequiredConsent
note right of Service
  pending: next_step으로 안내 (consent → verify → profile), consent_required = false
  active: next_step = null, 개정된 필수 약관에 동의하지 않았으면 consent_required = true
  null 배열(activities, hashtags, links)은 []로 응답
end note
Service --> Controller: UserInfoDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { id, type, status, next_step, name, email,\nconsent_required, student, graduated }

@enduml
